# ==============================================================================
# AICTE Integrated Dashboard - Frontend Production Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.production or set these in your CI/CD platform (Vercel, Netlify, Docker, etc.).
# 2. Replace placeholder URLs with your verified production domain over HTTPS.
